<title>USA: Tele-Comms announces stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Tele-Comms announces stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colorado 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc announced on Friday it would pay a stock dividend for Liberty Media Group shareholders of one share of Liberty Media Group for every two shares of Liberty Media Group Series A or Series B stock.</p>
<p>It also said that holders of TCI Series A Liberty Media Group common and TCI Series B Liberty Media Group common would receive one share of Series A Liberty Media common for every two shares of Series A Liberty Media Group stock held and one share of Series A Liberty Media Group stock for every two shares of Series B Liberty Media Group Stock held.</p>
<p>The company was not available to comment on the reason for the stock dividends.</p>
</text>
